.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-keyring\-list \- List keys in a keyring
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq keyring list\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
List keys in a keyring.
.PP
Prints the fingerprint as well as the primary userid for every certificate encountered in the keyring.
.PP


.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Subcommand options"
.TP
\fB\-\-all\-userids\fR
List all user IDs
.IP
Include user IDs that are expired, revoked, or not valid under the standard policy.
.TP
 \fIFILE\fR
Read from FILE or stdin if FILE is '\-'
.IP
[default: \fB\-\fR]
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.PP

.PP
List all certificates.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq keyring list certs.pgp
.RE
.PP
.fi

.PP
List all certificates with a user ID on example.org.
.PP
.nf
.RS
sq keyring filter \-\-experimental \-\-domain=example.org \\
.RE
.RS
.RS
certs.pgp \\
.RE
.RE
.RS
.RS
| sq keyring list
.RE
.RE
.fi
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1), \fBsq\-keyring\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
